        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan McCafferty, Eddie Vedder\n- Organizations: Nazareth, Pearl Jam\n- Places: Dunfermline, Scotland\n- Roles: vocalist, singer, songwriter, guitarist\n\nFacts:\n- Dan McCafferty was born on 14 October 1946 in Dunfermline, Scotland.\n- Dan McCafferty is a Scottish vocalist.\n- Dan McCafferty was the lead singer of the Scottish hard rock band Nazareth from its founding in 1968 until his retirement from touring with the band in 2013.\n- Eddie Vedder was born as Edward Louis Severson on December 23, 1964.\n- Eddie Vedder is an American musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- Eddie Vedder is best known as a member of Pearl Jam, where he performs lead vocals and is one of three guitarists.",
